# Read by `pixi run paper-lint` via `chktex -l paper/chktexrc`.
#
# Disabled warnings, each a false positive on this paper's conventions:
#   1  \cmd at a line end, e.g. \nolinenumbers
#   8  en dashes in pairs (node--store, input--output) and hyphens in
#      version names (Isabelle2025-2)
#  12  a sentence ending in `).` or before a macro such as \oblig{...}
#  24  space before \label, which never reaches the output
#  36  space before `(` in math and TikZ coordinates
CmdLine { -n1 -n8 -n12 -n24 -n36 }
